+## 2026-06-09/10 (GAP-4 rule-execution verifier — FIRST POSITIVE of the program, adversarially confirmed as scoped — outer-loop, Claude Fable 5)
+
+- [outer-loop] Operator: "Go with GAP-4." Built `scripts/experiments/arc3_gap4_rule_exec_verifier.py` (codex gpt-5.5 induces `def transform(grid)` from demo pairs ONLY — no task id, no candidates, no gold in the prompt; model-free verifier requires exact reproduction of ALL demos; the demo-perfect program executes on the test input; the GATED rerank promotes the exact-matching candidate to rank 1, else no-ops to vote) + 7 asserting unit tests. Reused the ARC-AGI-3 M2-v3 sandbox/refactor-loop machinery. **Sandbox lesson (regression-tested): numpy ops lazily call `__import__` internally — a bare-builtins restricted namespace crashed EVERY program (the smoke-run bug, demo_fit=0.0 across the board); fixed with a numpy-only `__import__`.**
+- **Run (30 unique tasks, 44 codex calls / 23 min, no GPU, conductor untouched): POSITIVE — `results/arc3_gap4_rule_exec_verifier.json`:** 29/31 entries demo-perfect; GATED pass@2 **0.5806 vs vote 0.4516** (pass@1 0.5484 vs 0.4194); recovered 4 of the 5 vote-missed headroom tasks (17cae0c1 vote-rank-65, be03b35f, c3202e5a the one-cell-diff task, f3e62deb) with ZERO pass@2 vote-wins lost; ~80% of the oracle headroom captured. Programs archived verbatim (`results/arc3_gap4_induced_programs.json`) — the entire rerank re-derives deterministically with zero API calls.
+- **Adversarial round (`results/arc3_gap4_adversarial_verify.json`): 5/5 POSITIVE_CONFIRMED as scoped; worst severity major (reporting/attribution).** All numbers re-derived bit-exact 5×; all 31 programs audited generic (no hardcoded grids, mutation-battery clean, no prompt leak, pool labels verified against official Kaggle gold). MUST-CARRY reframings (in-place as `corrigendum_2026_06_10_gap4`): (1) exact paired sign test p=0.0625 one-sided — NOT yet significant at n=31; tie-robust recovery count is 3 (c3202e5a rides a 15-15 vote tie); (2) **the lift is GENERATOR-attributable** — codex-standalone scores 26/31 = 0.8387 against TRUE gold, ABOVE the pool oracle ceiling 0.6129 (the pool restriction discards 11 codex-correct answers; trivial codex-first arm = 0.903); the gate's verified contribution is the zero-pass@2-loss safety wrapper; (3) **contamination sharpened**: 30/31 tasks appear verbatim in public ARC-AGI-2 TRAINING data — the 29/31 induction rate has near-zero transfer value; (4) one pass@1 gate mis-fire (25094a63); (5) codex ran sandbox-bypassed on a host with the solutions file readable (prompt-level no-oracle verified; agent-level unauditable — jail it next time).
+- **Ledger:** GAP-4 entry updated in `ops/verifier_gaps.md` with the defensible claim + forward protocol (sandboxed 400-task re-confirmation on held-out tasks, codex-first arm, cluster bootstrap + exact tests, hardened exec sandbox, local open-weight generator arm). Memory updated. The program's arc: 4 adversarially-confirmed negatives (scalar/latent/content-energy) → lineage retired → the execution/program-synthesis route the retirement pointed at delivers the first confirmed headroom recovery, with honest attribution to the generator and the venue's clipping effect quantified.
